# 憑證配置範本

## 使用說明
1. 複製此檔案為 `credentials.json`
2. 填入實際的憑證資訊
3. 確保 `credentials.json` 已加入 `.gitignore`

## Yahoo Shopping API
```json
{
  "yahoo": {
    "token": "YOUR_SUPPLIER_TOKEN",
    "keyValue": "YOUR_KEY_VALUE",
    "keyIV": "YOUR_KEY_IV",
    "saltKey": "YOUR_SALT_KEY"
  }
}
```

## PChome API
```json
{
  "pchome": {
    "vendor_id": "YOUR_VENDOR_ID",
    "encrypt_key": "YOUR_ENCRYPT_KEY_32_CHARS",
    "encrypt_iv": "YOUR_ENCRYPT_IV_16_CHARS"
  }
}
```

## MOMO API
```json
{
  "momo": {
    "company_id": "YOUR_COMPANY_ID",
    "vendor_id": "YOUR_VENDOR_ID",
    "otp_last_3_digits": "YOUR_OTP_LAST_3",
    "main_account": "YOUR_MAIN_ACCOUNT",
    "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
  }
}
```

## 完整範例 (credentials.json)
```json
{
  "yahoo": {
    "token": "Supplier_XXXXX",
    "keyValue": "YOUR_BASE64_KEY_VALUE",
    "keyIV": "YOUR_BASE64_KEY_IV",
    "saltKey": "YOUR_SALT_KEY"
  },
  "pchome": {
    "vendor_id": "XXXXX",
    "encrypt_key": "YOUR_32_CHAR_HEX_KEY",
    "encrypt_iv": "YOUR_16_CHAR_HEX_IV"
  },
  "momo": {
    "company_id": "XXXXXXXX",
    "vendor_id": "XXXXXX",
    "otp_last_3_digits": "XXX",
    "main_account": "XXXXXXXX",
    "password": "YOUR_PASSWORD"
  }
}
```

## 安全提醒
- ⚠️ 絕不將 `credentials.json` 上傳至 Git
- ⚠️ 定期更換密鑰
- ⚠️ 使用環境變數或加密存儲更安全
